 Lathan"] " stepped on the curb and stumbled, allowing the USSR to take a lead of almost 10 metres. The GDR anchor runner was 400 world record holder and gold medalist " [:a {:href "/athletes/69683"} "Marita Koch"] ". Koch ran the fastest leg yet recorded (48.27), but could not fully close the margin on Nazarova, as the Soviets won by two metres."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} "Soviet Union"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "8"} [:a {:href "/athletes/77286"} "Tatyana Prorochenko"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77194"} "Tatyana Goyshchik"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77335"} "Nina Zyuskova"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77152"} "Irina Nazarova"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77176"} "Lyudmila Chernova"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/77320"} "Olga Syrovatskaya-Mineyeva"]]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} "East Germany"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {:colspan "8"} [:a {:href "/athletes/69702"} "Gabriele Löwe"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/69686"} "Barbara Krug"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/69642"} "Christina Lathan"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/69683"} "Marita Koch"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/69710"} "Dagmar Neubauer"] [:small {} " (DNS)"] " • " [:a {:href "/athletes/69741"} "Ellen Strophal-Streidt"] [: